{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 202,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.95471954345703,
        190.7857208251953,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Psychological support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.3905029296875,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "Psychological support was varied and could include self-help groups, alcohol cessation counselling",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.74658966064453,
        527.4279174804688,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "(56, 74, 120) and TB clubs  . Patients who had access to psychological support had higher rates of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.5938720703125,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "treatment completion and cure, as well as lower rates of treatment failure and loss to follow-up.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        527.3948364257812,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "However, the GDG expressed concerns about confounding in these studies due to the severity of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.62269592285156,
        527.443115234375,
        157.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "illness in the groups receiving support. Additionally, allocation of patients to the support groups was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.8227081298828,
        179.87608337402344,
        170.2657012939453
      ],
      "text": "not always randomized.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.52674865722656,
        527.4300537109375,
        191.96974182128906
      ],
      "text": "When considering these data, it should also be noted that types of psychological support are very",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        190.72669982910156,
        527.5286865234375,
        205.16969299316406
      ],
      "text": "broad and may not be adequately represented in this review. To maximize health equity, psychological",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97216510772705,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.92665100097656,
        373.6092529296875,
        218.36964416503906
      ],
      "text": "support should be targeted at the most marginalized populations.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        231.74380493164062,
        209.15652465820312,
        247.59579467773438
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        254.80384826660156,
        527.4322509765625,
        269.2468566894531
      ],
      "text": "The evidence that was reviewed did not allow for conclusions about the advantages of treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        268.0037841796875,
        527.4465942382812,
        282.4468078613281
      ],
      "text": "support over SAT or vice versa for TB patients; however, in a subgroup analysis of TB patients living",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.20379638671875,
        527.4443359375,
        295.6468200683594
      ],
      "text": "with HIV, treatment support showed clear benefit with significantly improved treatment outcomes. It",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        294.40380859375,
        527.4027099609375,
        308.8468322753906
      ],
      "text": "is probable that treatment support may not be beneficial for all patients but that it is likely to have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        307.60382080078125,
        527.438720703125,
        322.0468444824219
      ],
      "text": "more benefit in certain subgroups of TB patients. Apart from HIV-positive TB patients, other factors",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        320.8038024902344,
        527.3970947265625,
        335.246826171875
      ],
      "text": "or groups of patients that were more or less likely to result in treatment adherence (and therefore",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.0038146972656,
        456.4018859863281,
        348.44683837890625
      ],
      "text": "require treatment support) were not examined in the scope of the systematic review.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.8210144042969,
        245.23455810546875,
        377.6730041503906
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        394.0209045410156,
        261.2004699707031,
        409.680908203125
      ],
      "text": "Treatment adherence interventions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        416.8887939453125,
        527.3496704101562,
        431.3318176269531
      ],
      "text": "As treatment support alone is not likely to be sufficient to ensure good TB treatment outcomes,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        430.0888977050781,
        527.4154663085938,
        444.53192138671875
      ],
      "text": "additional interventions for treatment adherence need to be provided. Patient education should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.288818359375,
        527.4321899414062,
        457.7318420410156
      ],
      "text": "provided to all patients on TB treatment. A package of the other treatment adherence interventions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        456.4888916015625,
        527.2649536132812,
        470.9319152832031
      ],
      "text": "also needs to be offered to patients on the basis of an assessment of individual patients’ needs,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        469.6888122558594,
        326.3905944824219,
        484.1318359375
      ],
      "text": "providers’ resources and conditions for implementation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        491.3927917480469,
        527.6400146484375,
        505.8358154296875
      ],
      "text": "With regard to telephone or video-assisted interventions, there may be reluctance to use new",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.5927734375,
        527.571044921875,
        519.0357666015625
      ],
      "text": "technology, making implementation more difficult. There may be privacy concerns regarding the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.7928466796875,
        527.386962890625,
        532.23583984375
      ],
      "text": "security of telephone data, so encryption and other measures to safeguard privacy will need to be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.9927978515625,
        527.5753784179688,
        545.435791015625
      ],
      "text": "considered. The feasibility of implementing these types of interventions depends on telecommunications",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.1928100585938,
        527.1098022460938,
        558.6358032226562
      ],
      "text": "infrastructure, telephone availability and connection costs. Multiple organizations have initiated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        557.392822265625,
        527.4013061523438,
        571.8358154296875
      ],
      "text": "programmes such as these, so TB programmes may find it helpful to collaborate and communicate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        570.5927734375,
        494.4465026855469,
        585.0357666015625
      ],
      "text": "with other medical service delivery programmes that have already set up such infrastructure.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.2966918945312,
        527.4111938476562,
        606.7396850585938
      ],
      "text": "There may be reluctance on the part of implementers (e.g. national or local governments, health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.4967041015625,
        527.1285400390625,
        619.939697265625
      ],
      "text": "partners) to pay for incentives. Implementers may be more willing to pay for material support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.6967163085938,
        527.3967895507812,
        633.1397094726562
      ],
      "text": "for smaller subgroups at particularly high risk (e.g. patients with MDR-TB). However, one of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        630.6207275390625,
        527.4093017578125,
        646.3397216796875
      ],
      "text": "(121) components of the End TB Strategy   is to provide “social protection and poverty alleviation” for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.0966796875,
        527.4345092773438,
        659.5396728515625
      ],
      "text": "patients with TB. The strategy specifically calls for measures to “alleviate the burden of income loss",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.2966918945312,
        527.3568115234375,
        672.7396850585938
      ],
      "text": "and non-medical costs of seeking and staying in care”. Included in the suggested measures are social",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993698120117188,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.4967041015625,
        527.3904418945312,
        685.939697265625
      ],
      "text": "welfare payments, vouchers and food packages. The benefit of material support found in this review",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.4207153320312,
        330.5040283203125,
        699.1397094726562
      ],
      "text": "(121). supports these components of the End TB Strategy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.400634765625,
        527.42333984375,
        720.8436279296875
      ],
      "text": "In order to distribute the material support, a government or nongovernmental organization (NGO)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.6005859375,
        527.3870849609375,
        734.0435791015625
      ],
      "text": "infrastructure would need to be in place, including anti-fraud mechanisms (e.g. reliable unique",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        732.8007202148438,
        527.3936767578125,
        747.2437133789062
      ],
      "text": "personal identifiers) and appropriate accounting to ensure that incentives are distributed equitably",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        746.000732421875,
        527.5739135742188,
        760.4437255859375
      ],
      "text": "and to the people who need them most. Countries should choose incentives that are the most",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.20068359375,
        208.1054229736328,
        773.6436767578125
      ],
      "text": "appropriate for their situation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "188 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}